---
description: All program source files live in src/
alwaysApply: true
---

All application source code belongs in the `src/` folder:

- Entry point: `src/index.ts`
- Configs: `src/configs/`
- Cache: `src/cache/`
- Domain models: `src/domain/`
- Redis: `src/redis/`
- HTTP: `src/http/`
- Wiring: `src/wiring/`

Keep config files (package.json, tsconfig, etc.) and tooling at the project root. Do not put source files at the root or outside `src/`.
